      "id": "504",
      "title": "Service of notice in case of discontinued business.",
      "indent": 0,
      "line_start": 6,
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 1,
      "text_before_clauses": "Where an assessment is to be made under section 320, the Assessing Officer may serve on the—",
      "clauses": [
        {
          "type": "clause",
          "number": "a",
          "id": "504-a",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 7,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "person whose income is to be assessed; or",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "type": "clause",
          "number": "b",
          "id": "504-b",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 8,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "person who was a member of a firm or association of persons at the time of its discontinuance, in the case of a firm or an association of persons; or",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "type": "clause",
          "number": "c",
          "id": "504-c",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 9,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "principal officer, in the case of a company, a notice containing all or any of the requirements which may be included in a notice under section 268(1) and the provisions of this Act shall, so far as may be, apply accordingly as if the notice were a notice issued under that section.",
